 "relaxation": "For every image and merge strength, the boundary threshold is the smallest value on the ladder 0.15, 0.20, ..., 1.00, infinity for which protected tokens + regions <= target tokens. Images that fit at 0.15 keep the original geometry exactly. Invalid-depth patches and small-region representatives stay protected at every threshold; if infinity does not fit, the condition is STRUCTURAL_INFEASIBLE and scores 0. The choice depends only on the depth map and was computed before inference.",
